{"product_id":"fascinating-footnotes-from-history","title":"fascinating footnotes from history","description":"\u003cp\u003eUnearthed from the vast collection of the National Archives by Giles Miltons metaphorical metal detecting, here are 100 nuggets of almost - but not quite - forgotten history and an astonishing cast, including dictators, adventurers, criminals and heroes, a war dog and the last Chinese eunuch. Among the footnotes we find the shipwrecked Dutch mariner who ate the last dodo; a kamikaze pilot who survived; and the mystery of the lighthouse men who disappeared from the Flannan Isles.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 198 x 27\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Giles Milton\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781473652033\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages:\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45834251829401,"sku":"17RD-29781473652033","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ff2108a39d2_fascinating_footnotes_from_history_Giles_Milton.jpg?v=1761582607","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/fascinating-footnotes-from-history","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}